    "updated_at": "2021-12-09T02:47:04Z",
    "body": "Issue still persists for me after updating to 0.11.0\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/48161833/145323759-882f266e-565d-4368-a32e-7f86e92ebfef.png)\r\n\r\nHere is a xonshrc that gives can reproduce the bug on my system\r\n```\r\n#!/usr/bin/env python \r\n\r\n# XONSH WEBCONFIG START\r\n# XONSH WEBCONFIG END\r\n\r\n# starship prompt\r\nexecx($(starship init xonsh))\r\n```\r\nI've also found that ctrl+c on vanilla xonsh prompt is not actually killing the processes bought foreground through `fg`.\r\nThis is most probably xonsh bug and I'll close this issue once I get confirmation from xonsh devs.",
